Acad Sci USA</source><year>1994</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>8631</fpage><lpage>8635</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8078935</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burkart</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Toguchi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Harshey</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The chemotaxis system, but not chemotaxis, is essential for swarming motility in <italic>Escherichia coli</italic>.</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1998</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>2568</fpage><lpage>2573</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9482927</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.95.5.2568</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fraser</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Swarming motility.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Microbiol</source><year>1999</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>630</fpage><lpage>635</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10607626</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S1369-5274(99)00033-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bassler</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Small talk. Cell-to-cell communication in bacteria.</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>2002</year><volume>109</volume><fpage>421</fpage><lpage>424</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12086599</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fuqua</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Parsek</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>